        <div class="notes" id="notes-47217682" data-guid="47217682"></div>
        <div id="questions-47217682" data-guid="47217682" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="47217682_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="47217683"><a alt="323-63.3A" class="litem_number" href="47217683#47217683" onclick="return false;" title="323-63.3A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Honorary street naming signs shall be affixed in a way which distinguishes them and does not detract from the primary street sign, either above or below the primary street sign, or in any other way that shall be clearly distinguishable from the primary street sign.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="47217684"><a alt="323-63.3B" class="litem_number" href="47217684#47217684" onclick="return false;" title="323-63.3B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Honorary street naming signs shall have a distinct design, as determined by the Division of Traffic Engineering, and be in contrasting color to distinguish them from primary street name signs.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="47217685"><a alt="323-63.3C" class="litem_number" href="47217685#47217685" onclick="return false;" title="323-63.3C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Honorary street naming signs shall remain affixed for a period of 10 years, except as otherwise authorized by resolution of the Common Council.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="47217686"><a alt="323-63.3D" class="litem_number" href="47217686#47217686" onclick="return false;" title="323-63.3D">D. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Upon expiration of honorary street naming sign affixation, the City may remove the signage. Upon removal, such signage shall be provided to the signage recipient listed on an application or, if contact is unable to be made, to the applicant.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </main>
